WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.175
Paper B's usage section keeps

2
00:00:02.175 --> 00:00:04.380
testing the same few things.

3
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:05.962
Learn them once.

4
00:00:06.287 --> 00:00:08.091
Subject–verb agreement.

5
00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:09.465
One of the boys is,

6
00:00:09.465 --> 00:00:10.140
not are.

7
00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:13.463
Articles. And prepositions: different from,

8
00:00:13.463 --> 00:00:14.628
senior to.

9
00:00:14.943 --> 00:00:16.487
Each of the students has

10
00:00:16.487 --> 00:00:17.276
a book.

11
00:00:17.276 --> 00:00:19.737
Each takes a singular verb.

12
00:00:20.415 --> 00:00:23.117
Learn new words inside sentences,

13
00:00:23.117 --> 00:00:24.815
not from lists.

14
00:00:25.151 --> 00:00:26.422
Your turn.

15
00:00:26.422 --> 00:00:28.652
Which sentence is correct?
